# Cybernetic Specialist's enters trigger surveils its controller's top card and keeps it there (CR 701.25a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Cybernetic Specialist
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Cybernetic Specialist.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Arrange(Island |)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Cybernetic Specialist; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 16
Bot2.Library.Count = 13
